\section{Symplectic Multiscale Simulation Kernel}
%===========================================================

\subsection{Hamiltonian Dynamics}

State vectors $\mathbf{x}(t)$ and momenta $\mathbf{p}(t)$ evolve via:

\[
\frac{d\mathbf{x}}{dt} = \frac{\partial H}{\partial \mathbf{p}} 
+ \Psi_{\mathrm{RO}}
\]

\[
\frac{d\mathbf{p}}{dt} = -\frac{\partial H}{\partial \mathbf{x}}
\]

\subsection{Störmer-Verlet Integration}

The symplectic update rule:

\[
\mathbf{p}_{n+1/2} = \mathbf{p}_n 
- \frac{\Delta t}{2}\nabla_{\mathbf{x}}H(\mathbf{x}_n)
\]

\[
\mathbf{x}_{n+1} = \mathbf{x}_n + \Delta t\,\mathbf{p}_{n+1/2}
\]

\[
\mathbf{p}_{n+1} = \mathbf{p}_{n+1/2}
- \frac{\Delta t}{2}\nabla_{\mathbf{x}}H(\mathbf{x}_{n+1})
\]

